        {
          "text": "Lino angelo wa-Jehova wakazwa ku-Giligala, wakasika ku-Bokimu. Wakati, Ndakamugwisya mucisi ca-Egepita, ndakamuniizya munyika eyo njindakakonkezya bamauso, elyo ndakaamba kuti, Nsikooyoojaya cizuminano cangu ncintangene anywe kukabe kutamani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
