        {
          "text": "Lino Jehova naakababusizya babetesi, Jehova kali amubetesi, akubavuna kumaanza aabasinkondonyina mazuba oonse ngaakapona oyo mubetesi, nkaambo Jehova wakeempwa naakamvwa mbubakali kutongela nkaambo kabaabo ibakali kubapenzya akubafwabya. ",
          "type": "text",
